# Expo foundations

Load `expo-overview` before other Expo skills, then the leaf skill it names.

- New apps use Expo Router and the current SDK. Add Expo packages with `npx expo install`.
- Apply `expo-project-structure` only when the app has no layout yet. Leave an existing layout in place.
- Routes stay in `app/` or `src/app/`. Screens, shared components, and server code live outside the routes folder.
- Match an official `expo/examples` project before inventing a third-party integration.
- Upgrade with `expo-upgrade`. Do not bump single Expo packages past the SDK.
